   "top": {
    "KOCCA is proud to present ITS GAME at Grand Ballroom, COEX, Seoul in June, 2018.ITS GAME is the biggest game-related B2B business meeting in South Korea, improving the business atmosphere within prominent Korean game companies and international game publishers interested in Korean games. Please join us and don't miss out on the opportunities to interact with Korean game industry.": 1,
    "<p>Global Contents Conference (previously named as DICON and held since 2001) is is the conference devoted to globalizing the contents. We share about global issues, trends and future prospects of the content industry and talk about the future direction of industry development to prepare for the global business of next generation.</p>": 1,
    "■ Overview<br>  ㅇ Event : ITS GAME 2019<br>    ㅇ Date : 18 - 19 June 2019<br>    ㅇ Venue : Grand Ballroom, COEX, Seoul<br>  ㅇ Organizer : Korea Creative Content Agency<br>  ㅇ Program : 1:1 Business Meeting, Networking Event, etc.<br><br>■ Buyer Registration<br>    ㅇ Date : 13 May – 5 June 2019<br>  ㅇ Qualifications : Game Publisher, Game Platform, Investment Company<br>  ㅇ Benefits<br>   - Free registration fee<br>   - 1 business meeting room per company<br>   - 1 interpreter per company for business meetings<br>   - Accommodation for 1 person per company(Maximum 2 nights, Check-in : 17 June, Check-out : 19 June)": 1,
    "ㅇ Event Title : K-Content EXPO 2019 Russiaㅇ Date : August 31st - September 3rd  - B2C : August 31st - September 1st  - B2B : September 2nd - September 3rd ㅇ Venue : Moscow, Russia ": 1,
    "ㅇ Event Title : K-Content EXPO 2019 Dubaiㅇ Date : October 16th – October 18th ㅇ Venue : DWTC, Dubai UAE": 1,
    "2019 Global Contents Conference 2019 Global Contents Conference is an International Event where all the leading industries gathered together for cooperating opportunities centered on Korean contents. Through main programs like K-Contents trade fair and conference, promising future businesses with K-partners will await upon your visit.Date 9th(Mon)–11th(Wed)December2019Location Dongdaemun Design Plaza (DDP), Seoul, Republic of Korea": 1,
    "&lt;div class=&quot;event-cont&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;KOCCA-KITA K-Content Online Business Meeting 2021&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;1. Background&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>ㅇ Online Business Meetings are needed to replace offline export exhibitions and business sessions due to the continuous influence of Corona 19</p><p>ㅇ Based on the successful results in 2020, KOCCA(Korea Creative Content Agency) and KITA(Korea International Trade Association) will continue to seek an opportunities in overseas content market in 2021&lt;br&gt;    ※ Attachment: 2020 K-Content Online Business Meeting</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;event-cont&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;2. Overview &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>ㅇ Title : 2021 K-Content Online Business Meeting</p><p>ㅇ Date : June 23, 2021. (Wed.), 10:00–18:00</p><p>ㅇ Location : COEX Startup Branch</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;event-cont&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;3. Event &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;!-- table //--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tb-wrap line&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;tb-view&quot;&gt;\t&lt;caption&gt;&lt;strong&gt;event info&lt;/strong&gt;\t<p>Sortation,Program,ETC</p>\t&lt;/caption&gt;\t&lt;colgroup&gt;\t\t&lt;col style=&quot;width: 20%;&quot; /&gt;\t\t&lt;col style=&quot;width: 60%;&quot; /&gt;\t\t&lt;col style=&quot;width: 20%;&quot; /&gt;\t&lt;/colgroup&gt;\t&lt;thead&gt;\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Sortation&lt;/th&gt;\t\t\t&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Program&lt;/th&gt;\t\t\t&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;ETC&lt;/th&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t&lt;/thead&gt;\t&lt;tbody&gt;\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td&gt;Online Business Meeting&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;- Participated 47 Korean Content Companies&lt;br&gt; ※Character26, Game12, Comics3, Animation3, Immersive Content3 &lt;br&gt;- Recruting Buyers from RCEP Countries&lt;br&gt;- Operating 1:1 Online Business Meeting&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Operation Time10:00~18:00&lt;/td&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td&gt;Seminar&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;- Australia &lt;br&gt; ① Australian Content Industry Landscape&lt;br&gt; ② Cases of Korean company entering Australia&lt;br&gt;- Indonesia &lt;br&gt; ① Enterprise opportunities and prospects following RCEP conclusion&lt;br&gt; ② Cases of Korean company entering Indonesia&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Up to 2hours&lt;/td&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;4. Schedules &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>ㅇ Seminar detailed plan confirmed: ~5.28 (Friday)&lt;br&gt;ㅇ Buyer matching status 1st round: –6.2(Wednesday)&lt;br&gt;ㅇ PR start: 6.7 (Monday)~&lt;br&gt;ㅇ Final collection of buyer matching status: ~6.18 (Friday)&lt;br&gt;ㅇ Event held: 6.23 (Wednesday)</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Seminar Outline - Australia&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;1. Overview&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>ㅇ (Necessity) &lt;br&gt;▲ Increased interest in the Australian content market due to the conclusion of RCEP &lt;br&gt;▲ Need to share know-how on the Australian market with relatively few cases of entry&lt;br&gt;ㅇ (Program) Strategic Seminar to Enter the Australian Content Market&lt;br&gt;ㅇ (Date/Place) 2021.6.23. (Wed) 13:00–15:00 / COEX Startup Branch&lt;br&gt;   ※ Upon Details may vary slightly depending on matters.</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;event-cont&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;2. Detail &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>ㅇ (Format) &lt;br&gt;   - Expert Speech at the sight(Online/Open link)&lt;br&gt;   - 25min Speech + 5min Conversation(Commentator with Pre-Question)&lt;br&gt; ㅇ (Expert) Sangah Yun, Manager of  Australian Trade and Investment Commission(Australian Embassy)&lt;br&gt; ㅇ (Subject) Australian Content Industry Landscape&lt;br&gt;   - Aus-Kor Economic Relationship &lt;br&gt;   - Content Industry Statics, Numbers, Facts etc&lt;br&gt;   - Insight for Korean Content Companies&lt;br&gt;   ※ Upon Details are adjusting in progress</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;event-cont&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;3. Schedules&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>ㅇ Week 4 of May: Seminar planning and casting confirmed&lt;br&gt;ㅇ June 2nd: PR Include the seminar details&lt;br&gt;ㅇ 3rd week of June: Seminar material sharing&lt;br&gt;ㅇ June 23rd(Event Day)&lt;br&gt;  -   ~11:30: Arrival on-site&lt;br&gt;  - 11:40~1200: Lunch with Key Members&lt;br&gt;  - 12:50~13:00 : System Check (Audio/Video, Presentation Material)&lt;br&gt;  - 13:30~14:00: Speech</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Result of K-Content Online Business Meeting 2020&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;1. Overview&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>□ Title : 2020 K-Content Online Business Meeting &lt;br&gt; □ Date : 6.30 (Tuesday), 10:00–18:00&lt;br&gt; □ Organizer : Korea Creative Content Agency, Korea International Trade Association &lt;br&gt; □ Location : COEX Startup Branch&lt;br&gt; □ Participants &lt;br&gt;  ◦ Seller: 34 total companies &lt;br&gt;  ◦ Overseas buyers: 55 people from 52 companies&lt;br&gt; □ Corpotate Meeting&lt;br&gt;  ◦(date/place) 6.30 (Tuesday), 13:30–14:00 / COEX 2nd floor startup branch&lt;br&gt;  ◦(Participants) Japanese buyers (Amazon Japan, Shuaysia Cartoon Mee Editorial Department), Korean companies (CJENM, CNC Revolution) &lt;br&gt;      </p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;event-cont&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;2. Detail &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p> □ Key Outcome&lt;br&gt;   ㅇ Biz-Matching: 104 Cases&lt;br&gt;   ㅇ Final Contracts: 38 Cases&lt;br&gt;   ㅇ Final Amount: Approximate 6.5 Million USD &lt;br&gt; □ PR&lt;br&gt;  ㅇ Whole Number 152 Cases</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- table //--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tb-wrap line&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;tb-view&quot;&gt;\t&lt;caption&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PR&lt;/strong&gt;\t<p>Sortation,Number,Media</p>\t&lt;/caption&gt;\t&lt;colgroup&gt;\t\t&lt;col style=&quot;width: 20%;&quot; /&gt;\t\t&lt;col style=&quot;width: 20%;&quot; /&gt;\t\t&lt;col style=&quot;width: 60%;&quot; /&gt;\t&lt;/colgroup&gt;\t&lt;thead&gt;\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Sortation&lt;/th&gt;\t\t\t&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Number &lt;/th&gt;\t\t\t&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Media&lt;/th&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t&lt;/thead&gt;\t&lt;tbody&gt;\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td&gt;Print&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;동아일보, 매일경제, 서울경제 등 &lt;/td&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td&gt;Broadcast&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;KBS, YTN 등&lt;/td&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td&gt;Online&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;141&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;한국일보, 문화일보, 헤럴드경제 등&lt;/td&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t\t\t\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td&gt;Tatal&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;152&lt;/td&gt;\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\t&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--// table --&gt;&lt;!--// table --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sb-cont&quot;&gt;<p>ㅇ Key News Reports</p><p> - (연합뉴스) 코로나19에 막힌 콘텐츠 수출길, 화상 상담회로 뚫다&lt;br&gt;     https://www.yna.co.kr/view/AKR20200630082800005&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;   - (IT조선) 온라인 수출상담회는 포스트 코로나 시대 ‘뉴노멀’&lt;br&gt;     http://it.chosun.com/site/data/html_dir/2020/06/30/2020063003296.html&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;      - (YTN) 코로나로 막힌 콘텐츠 수출길, 온라인으로 뚫는다&lt;br&gt;     ytn.co.kr/_In/0106_202007010014231782&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;   - (이코노믹리뷰) 콘텐츠 수출‘울상’...비대면으로 기회 찾는다&lt;br&gt;      https://www.econovill.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=402863</p>&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;": 1,
